<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`LIST_STAT_SUM_SQUARES: number = 7`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer LIST_STAT_SUM_SQUARES = 7;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant LIST_STAT_SUM_SQUARES has the value 7</p>
  <p>Calculates the sum of the squares of the numbers in a list.</p>
  <p>That is, for each number <i>N_i</i> in a list of <i>k</i> elements, it calculates <i>N_1</i>N_1 + N_2<i>N_2 + ... + N_k </i> N_k*.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Member Of</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>ListStatisticsOperation</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`local sum_of_squares = ll.ListStatistics(LIST_STAT_SUM_SQUARES, numList)`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`float sum_of_squares = llListStatistics( LIST_STAT_SUM_SQUARES, numList );`} lang="lsl" /></div>
